{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 794 of the Cyber Century, the nation was managed by a giant computer called &quot;Elixia.&quot; Elixia controlled all aspects of politics, economy, and the military, making war and poverty a thing of the past. However, that peace suddenly crumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified enemies appeared in cyberspace and began to erode the system of Elixia. The city's infrastructure was in chaos, communication networks were cut off, and people faced fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In response to this situation, cyberdiver &quot;Ayame Crow&quot; began investigating cyberspace. Cyberdivers are people with special abilities who can directly connect their consciousness to cyberspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind this crisis, it was discovered that there was a human being called &quot;Phantom&quot; who uploaded his mind into cyberspace. He was plotting to control Elixia in order to lead humanity to chaos that he called freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayame boards the cyber fighter Image Striker and contacts Elixir. Now, the battle to save humanity from crisis begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1758692873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/fd84b1c0aed06af9b0426cd953d9865cc97a23cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758692873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/085d5512aa2d3b67a2e0447e000d3c094e24dc2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758692873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/085d5512aa2d3b67a2e0447e000d3c094e24dc2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758692873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3649830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 794 of the Cyber Century, the nation was managed by a giant computer called &quot;Elixia.&quot; Elixia controlled all aspects of politics, economy, and the military, making war and poverty a thing of the past. However, that peace suddenly crumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified enemies appeared in cyberspace and began to erode the system of Elixia. The city's infrastructure was in chaos, communication networks were cut off, and people faced fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In response to this situation, cyberdiver &quot;Ayame Crow&quot; began investigating cyberspace. Cyberdivers are people with special abilities who can directly connect their consciousness to cyberspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind this crisis, it was discovered that there was a human being called &quot;Phantom&quot; who uploaded his mind into cyberspace. He was plotting to control Elixia in order to lead humanity to chaos that he called freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayame boards the cyber fighter Image Striker and contacts Elixir. Now, the battle to save humanity from crisis begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","deve